计算留数：
$$\operatorname{Res}[R(z),i]=\lim_{z\to i}\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}z}\left[(z-i)^2R(z)\right]
=\lim_{z\to i}\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}z}\frac{1}{(z+i)^2}
=\lim_{z\to i}\frac{-2}{(z+i)^3}
=\frac{-2}{(2i)^3}=\frac{-2}{-8i}=\frac{1}{4i}.$$

